                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by General Chou
                            En-lai to General Marshall</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 101.2–8</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-01-28">28 January 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: On Attacks made by the Nationalist Troops on
                    Communist-led Troops and Areas.</p>
                <p>Following table compiled from reports received here for the period ending 2400
                    January 25th shows major incidents of truce violation on part of Nationalist
                    forces since the truce deadline:</p>
                <p>[Here follows list of twenty-three incidents.]</p>
            </div>
